ne-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170401007401_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【世界杯动态】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a59140e98152native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷球员举马岛横幅！FIFA回应：正评估报告，考虑情况后再决定</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a582c880f55a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a582c880f55a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a582c880f55a.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-1英格兰赛后，阿根廷球员展示“马岛属于阿根廷”横幅，国际足联对此进行了回应。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a591607130a4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：特朗普将出席世界杯决赛，计划与因凡蒂诺一起颁发冠军奖杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/69331b37ca3ca.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.53" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/69331b37ca3ca.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/69331b37ca3ca.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">美国白宫新闻秘书卡罗琳·莱维特在简报会中确认，美国总统特朗普将出席世界杯决赛。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a5910ec17addnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗梅罗深情挽留梅西：如果我们决赛赢了，你就再多留几年好吗</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170112223778.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170112223778_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260717/202607170112223778_720.jpg"> </div><p>阿根廷2-1击败英格兰晋级决赛，据Tyc报道，罗梅罗挽留梅西希望他能多踢几年。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a592ae79f4c6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：世界杯冠军将获得定制冠军戒指，其中1996枚向全球球迷出售</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.78" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260717/202607170225221069.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.78" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.78" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260717/202607170225221069.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260717/202607170225221069.jpg"> </div><p>国际足联官方宣布，2026年世界杯冠军球员将获得冠军戒指，戒指还将对球迷发售。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a592f73cc7e4native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">凯恩：任何言语都无法驱散失落，我们努力了8年却始终差最后一步</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.63" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a534dc7d7924.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.63" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.63" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a534dc7d7924_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260712/6a534dc7d7924_720.jpg"> </div><p>英格兰1-2负于阿根廷，无缘决赛。英格兰队长凯恩发布社媒，表达了自己的失落，以及从头再来的决心。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a5933c95613enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">带伤踢世界杯！RMC：萨利巴确诊背部骨折，吃止痛药出战加重伤情</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a568f4024bee_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a568f4024bee_1280.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260715/6a568f4024bee_1280.jpg"> </div><p>RMC体育报道，萨利巴确诊为背部骨折，在世界杯开始前他就已经出现伤情，一直带伤作战最终伤情加重。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a58f7c2aab59native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">阿根廷总统：马岛是阿根廷的，标语事件最坏情况FIFA罚款3万美元</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a582c880f55a_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a582c880f55a.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a582c880f55a.jpg"> </div><p>针对阿根廷球员手持政治口号标语一事，阿根廷总统米莱于今日发表了看法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a58f85d75dffnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">恩佐击打颈部！孙葆洁：单独看是黄牌 但才开场3分钟判罚可以理解</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.55" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160306428895.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.55" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.55" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160306428895.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607160306428895.jpg"> </div><p>央视《豪门盛宴》节目中，孙葆洁针对恩佐手臂击打安德森颈部的动作，给出了自己的看法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-17/6a59053209ae7native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">决战！梅西：踢西班牙的比赛会很胶着，他们很出色但我了解他们</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a588003a4a26_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a588003a4a26.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/6a588003a4a26.jpg"> </div><p><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">淘汰英格兰后，阿根廷队长梅西接受采访，谈到球队晋级世界杯决赛、即将对阵西班牙以及与队友并肩作战的感受等话题。</span></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-07-16/6a58f9b95dc79native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">下一个会是谁？金球奖官方：历史上只有13人获得过金球奖+世界杯</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.31" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260716/202607162333324262.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text